    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A beautifully presented one-bedroom, first-floor, south-facing apartment in the sought-after and exclusive Hazelbrook Square development in Churchtown.\r\n\r\nPresented in impeccable, walk-in condition, the apartment offers 48 sq.m. of bright, spacious, and well-laid-out accommodation, a B1 BER rating, and a designated underground parking space behind secure gates.\r\n\r\nA welcoming entrance hall, complete with a large storeroom, leads into a spacious, open-plan living area. The contemporary kitchen boasts integrated appliances and sleek, high-gloss cabinetry, seamlessly flowing into the dining space and a generously sized sitting room. Floor-to-ceiling windows flood the space with natural light, and a balcony door opens onto a south-facing balcony. The well-proportioned bedroom features fitted wardrobes, and a luxurious bathroom completes the accommodation.\r\n\r\nNestled in the leafy and tranquil suburb of Churchtown, Hazelbrook Square sits on the site of the former Hazelbrook Dairy farm, famously known for HB ice cream. This modern and beautifully maintained development offers landscaped grounds, a playground, basketball court, and an extremely convenient location.\r\n\r\nResidents enjoy easy access to Nutgrove Shopping Centre and the charming Churchtown Village, both just moments away, offering an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, and shops right on your doorstep. \r\n\r\nNearby amenities include Dundrum Town Centre, Milltown Golf Club, Castle Golf Club, Brookfield Tennis Club, and Marlay Park. Excellent transport links, such as the M50 and the LUAS at Dundrum and Windy Arbour, provide swift access to the city centre as well as towards Sandyford and Cherrywood."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall (4.30m x 1.20m): Laminate floor and recessed lighting\r\nLiving Room (5.10m x 3.25m): A spacious reception room with floor-to-ceiling windows and access to private balcony.\r\nKitchen (1.88m x 2.50m): Fitted base and wall units, granite worktops, recessed integrated stainless-steel sink, integrated appliances, recessed lighting, tiled splashback, and floor.\r\nMain Bedroom (5.16m x 2.71m): Spacious double bedroom with laminate flooring and built-in wardrobes\r\nBathroom (2.00m x 2.15m): Fully tiled bathroom, recessed lighting, w.h.b., vanity unit, w.c., and bath with shower.\r\nStore Room (1.08m x 2.29m): Laminate Flooring and shelving, Gas Combi Boiler and Ventilation system.\r\nBalcony: (1.75m x 3.59m): South-facing balcony off living room."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Bright first-floor south-facing apartment.\r\nContemporary Development close to Churchtown Village, Nutgrove and Dundrum.\r\nSecure underground parking spaces behind security gates.\r\nBER B1\r\n48 sq. m. (517 sq. ft.) of well-proportioned accommodation\r\nGas-fired central heating with a combi boiler provides instant hot water.\r\nMechanical ventilation system.\r\nNo Rent Cap\r\nCurrent Service Charge approx. €1,700 per annum. Management Agent: Benchmark"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
